tle":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"8550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1021805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,65,63,51,48,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1021805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,65,63,51,48,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1021805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10250","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,65,63,51,48,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"97","reputation":"900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1021805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"一作王延，东吴江陵督，位至车骑将军。在晋灭吴之战中，被吴主孙皓任命为西线都督，负责迎击晋军主帅杜预。晋军水陆四面猛攻，江陵城防崩坏。杜预随即强攻江陵，城破后伍延诈降不成，弃城逃跑被俘，随即被处斩。江陵一破，东吴整条长江防线彻底崩溃，荆南诸郡全部望风归降。","tc":"一作王延，東吳江陵督，位至車騎將軍。在晉滅吳之戰中，被吳主孫皓任命為西線都督，負責迎擊晉軍主帥杜預。晉軍水陸四面猛攻，江陵城防崩壞。杜預隨即強攻江陵，城破后伍延詐降不成，棄城逃跑被俘，隨即被處斬。江陵一破，東吳整條長江防線徹底崩潰，荊南諸郡全部望風歸降。","en":"Also recorded as Wang Yan, Area Commander of Jiangling for Eastern Wu, who rose to Marshal. During Jin's conquest of Wu, he was appointed Viceroy of the western front by the Wu ruler Sun Hao to counter the Jin Commander, Du Yu. The Jin forces launched fierce assaults by water and land from all directions, causing the fortifications of Jiangling to crumble. Du Yu then stormed Jiangling, after the city fell, Wu Yan's attempted feigned surrender failed, and he was captured while fleeing after abandoning the city, whereupon he was executed. With the fall of Jiangling, Eastern Wu's entire Yangtze defense line collapsed, and all commanderies in southern Jing Province surrendered without resistance.","jp":"王延とも記される。東呉の江陵督を務め、位は車騎将軍にまで昇った。晋による呉平定戦において呉主・孫皓より西線の都督に任じられ、晋軍の主将である杜預の迎撃にあたった。晋軍が水陸四方から猛攻を仕掛け、江陵の城防が崩壊すると、杜預は直ちに江陵へ強襲を仕掛けた。落城後、伍延は偽装降伏に失敗して城を捨て逃走するも捕縛され、直ちに斬首された。江陵が陥落したことで東呉の長江防衛線は完全に崩壊し、荊南の諸郡はことごとく降伏した。","kr":"일설에는 왕연(王延)이라고도 전해지며, 동오의 강릉독을 지냈고 관직은 거기장군에 이르렀습니다. 진나라의 오 멸망전 당시 오나라 군주 손호에 의해 서선 도독으로 임명되어 진군 주장 두예를 요격하는 임무를 맡았습니다. 진군이 수륙 사방에서 맹공을 퍼붓자 강릉의 도시 방어가 무너졌습니다. 이어 두예가 강릉을 강공하여 성을 함락시켰고, 오연은 거짓 항복을 꾀했으나 실패하여 성을 버리고 달아나다 사로잡혀 곧 참수되었습니다. 강릉이 함락되자 동오의 장강 방어선 전체가 완전히 무너졌으며, 형남의 여러 군은 모두 소문만 듣고도 잇달아 항복했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1032415","remark":"普武","surname":"伍","surnameTc":"伍","surnameEn":"Wu","surnameJp":"伍","surnameKr":"오","surnameOther":"","name":"延","nameTc":"延","nameEn":"Yan","nameJp":"延","nameKr":"연","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"伍延","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"249","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"65","wise":"63","politics":"51","charm":"48","will":"80","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"67/18/61/18/18/41/11/18","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3400","battleSoulPoint":"3300","debateSoulPoint":"3200","strategy":"1000815","strategy2":"1001205;1000301","professions":"0/1/0/2/0/3/1/1/0/1/0/0/0/0/3/0/0/1/0/1/0/0/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"86","loy